sequenceDiagram
  participant test as Trusted operator rehearsal
  participant pg as PostgreSQL primary
  participant secret as Kubernetes Secrets
  participant watch as PgCat watcher
  participant proxy as PgCat replicas
  participant client as Existing and new clients
  client->>proxy: Keep established session active
  test->>pg: ALTER disposable role password
  test->>secret: Update application and PgCat configuration
  secret->>watch: Project updated configuration
  watch->>proxy: Atomically replace TOML
  proxy->>proxy: Reload configuration
  test->>pg: Verify new accepted and old rejected
  test->>proxy: Verify each proxy with both credentials
  client->>proxy: Continue established session
